@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Log In - Study Planner
actor Visitor
participant LoginView
participant AuthenticationForm
database Database

Visitor -> LoginView : POST /accounts/login/ (username, password)
LoginView -> AuthenticationForm : is_valid()
AuthenticationForm -> Database : findUser(username)
Database --> AuthenticationForm : user
AuthenticationForm -> AuthenticationForm : checkPassword(password)

alt credentials valid
    AuthenticationForm --> LoginView : valid
    LoginView --> Visitor : 302 Redirect to dashboard
else credentials invalid
    AuthenticationForm --> LoginView : invalid
    LoginView --> Visitor : 200 Login page with error message
end

@enduml
